---
const 
{ 
	title, 
	subtitle, 
} = Astro.props;
---

<div class="component">
	<div class="article">
		<div class="article-title">{title}</div>
		<div class="article-subtitle">{subtitle}</div>
		<div class="article-content">
			1. An advanced cleaning sim.
			<a href="/hazmat"> 
				<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"> 
					<path d="M15 10l5 5-5 5"></path> <path d="M4 4v7a4 4 0 004 4h12"></path> 
				</svg>
				Project Hazmat
			</a>

			2. An interactive horror expierience based on a reoccuring nightmare.
			<a href="/nightmare"> 
				<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"> 
					<path d="M15 10l5 5-5 5"></path> <path d="M4 4v7a4 4 0 004 4h12"></path> 
				</svg>
				Project Nightmare
			</a>

			3. A physics based action game.
			<a href="/gravput"> 
				<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"> 
					<path d="M15 10l5 5-5 5"></path> <path d="M4 4v7a4 4 0 004 4h12"></path> 
				</svg>
				Project GravPut
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>